{"title": "Unseen Culinary Specialist", "pageid": 16583, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Unseen_Culinary_Specialist", "categories": ["Environmental objects"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">      </p><aside class=\"portable-infobox noexcerpt searchaux pi-background pi-theme-default pi-layout-default pi-type-creature\"><figure class=\"pi-item pi-media pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"/w/images/f/f9/Dumbwaiter.jpg\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Dumbwaiter.jpg\">\n\t\t<img src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f9/Dumbwaiter.jpg/300px-Dumbwaiter.jpg.webp\" srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f9/Dumbwaiter.jpg/300px-Dumbwaiter.jpg.webp 1x, /w/images/thumb/f/f9/Dumbwaiter.jpg/599px-Dumbwaiter.jpg.webp 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" alt=\"Dumbwaiter.jpg\" width=\"270\" height=\"245\">\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure><div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"va\">\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Voice / Actor</h3>\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><ul style=\"list-style: none; margin: 0\"><li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.imdb.com/name/nm3332140\">Liane-Rose Bunce</a></li></ul></div>\n</div></aside>\nThe <b>Unseen Culinary Specialist</b> is an unknown person at the other end of the dumbwaiter (a small freight elevator or lift intended to carry food) inside the rented room at the <a href=\"/wiki/Elfsong_Tavern\" title=\"Elfsong Tavern\">Elfsong Tavern</a>. The party can interact with the dumbwaiter to buy <a href=\"/wiki/Supply_Pack\" title=\"Supply Pack\">Supply Packs</a>. \n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Involvement\">Involvement</span></h2>\n<p>When interacted with during the day, the following dialogue plays:\n</p>\n<ul><li><b>Narrator:</b> *You call out, but there is no answer. The staff operate the dumbwaiter at night*</li></ul>\n<p>When interacted with during the night, the Unseen Culinary Specialist responds with one of the following dialogues after the first encounter:\n</p>\n<ul><li><b>Unseen Culinary Specialist:</b> I have about four carts of potatoes to prep. <i>Quickly</i></li>\n<li><b>Unseen Culinary Specialist:</b> I just damn near chopped my finger off. This had better be good.</li>\n<li><b>Unseen Culinary Specialist:</b> You lot have stomachs like gaping caverns. What do you want?</li>\n<li><b>Unseen Culinary Specialist:</b> Gods, I don't get paid enough. <i>What?</i></li>\n<li><b>Unseen Culinary Specialist:</b> Back again. Thrill me with your delightful midnight order.</li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715023720\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.079 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.083 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3135/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 30906/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 14320/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 13/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1004/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.021/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 942578/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   80.456      1 -total\n 96.62%   77.739      1 Template:Infobox_creature\n 50.91%   40.957      1 Template:Infobox_creature/internal\n 39.12%   31.478      2 Template:Hidden_code\n 16.67%   13.410      1 Template:Template_style\n  7.70%    6.198     52 Template:Plus_if_pos\n  3.87%    3.110      2 Template:Credits\n  3.33%    2.679      1 Template:PageSeo\n  1.78%    1.429      1 Template:Main_namespace_only\n  1.10%    0.887     15 Template:Trim\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:16583-0!canonical and timestamp 20260715023720 and revision id 400770. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}